    std::cout << "The product was originally purchased for $" << PURCHASE_PRICE << ". ";
    std::cout << "It has a residual value of $" << RESIDUAL_VALUE << ", but a refund of $" << REFUND_AMOUNT << " has been agreed upon. ";
    std::cout << "This results in a refund of " << PERCENTAGE << "% ($" << REFUND_AMOUNT << ") of the original purchase price.\n";

    return 0;
}
```

